# Sprite atlas: the generator refuses to clobber a working file that has
# changed and writes the fresh build alongside it instead. Those copies are
# transient -- you diff them, take what you want, and delete them.
art-source/*-new.*

# Personal drafts that live in the working tree but must never be published.
# This repo IS the website, so a stray `git add -A` puts them on the public web.
